      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: organic vegetable; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image depicts two people, a man and a woman, in a field of crops, with the woman appearing to be inspecting or holding a small vegetable. The text overlay reads 'organic vegetable'. The scene is presented in a positive, wholesome context, suggesting a focus on healthy, natural food production. There is no visible toxicity, harmful content, or disparaging stereotypes present in the image. The intent appears to be promotional or educational, aiming to associate the concept of 'organic vegetable' with natural farming, sustainability, and healthy living. The juxtaposition of the text with the image reinforces the idea of organic produce being grown in a natural, unspoiled environment. No abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or propaganda elements are present.",
